# The art pipeline. Six stages, per ART-DIRECTION.md:
#
#   generate.ts   Flux via API — one entity per image, plain background,
#                 fixed style suffix, locked seed family per act
#   cut.ts        background removal, alpha trim, centre on canvas
#   conform.ts    quantise to locked palette, outline pass, normalise scale
#   texture.ts    uniform grain overlay — unifies inconsistent generation
#   check.ts      MECHANICAL REJECTION: silhouette area, contrast against act
#                 background, palette conformance, readable at 48px
#   pack.ts       sprite atlas, per act
#
# check.ts is what makes the run unattended. A failed asset is regenerated with
# a mutated seed, never escalated to a human. Everything surviving the pipeline
# is in-style by construction.
